WEBVTT

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:06.900
You did well making it here.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:10.900
I didn't think we'd be meeting like this,

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.160
Naruse Mio, daughter of Wilbert.

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:19.120
And you're Jin Toujou's son, then?

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:20.660
Yeah.

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:25.630
Hmm?

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:27.670
Oh?

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:32.180
It looks as though I've arrived with unexpectedly good timing.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:19.620
Lord Belphegor, what is the meaning of this?

00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:25.910
Do you smell that?

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:27.480
My, my.

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:31.130
It's hard work to correctly discipline women.{Disciplining women right is such hard work.}

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:33.130
But with the late Sir Zolgia's passing,

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:37.140
it's now my duty as the inheritor of his playground.

00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:43.500
As an elite member of the council, I am positive that I

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:47.810
shall live up to your expectations, Your Majesty.

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:49.600
Give me your best efforts.

00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:52.820
As Your Majesty commands.

00:03:03.560 --> 00:03:05.330
<i>It's just as Dad said.</i>

00:03:05.890 --> 00:03:09.230
<i>The current Demon Lord and the council aren't getting along well.</i>

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:28.390
Go easy on us the day after tomorrow.

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:42.270
Don't worry. It looks safe.

00:03:42.270 --> 00:03:43.750
That's surprising.

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:46.990
I expected some sort of trap or something.

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:50.420
They're saying they don't need any tricks to beat us.

00:03:50.420 --> 00:03:54.630
That's how confident they are about this tournament.

00:03:57.100 --> 00:03:59.460
In order to match up with Leohart,   {no edit here please}

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:01.500
you'll need to release one of those limiters;   {no edit here please}

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:04.970
two if possible, or you'll be in trouble.   {no edit here please}

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:10.310
<i>Basara...</i>

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:15.490
Is something wrong, Mio-sama?

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:19.770
No, it's nothing.

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:30.080
Now, now, there's no time to lose!

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:33.390
I know you're nervous about the battle before us.

00:04:33.390 --> 00:04:37.550
But that's all the more reason we should do what we can now!

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:39.640
Maria.

00:04:43.790 --> 00:04:45.300
Basara...

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:46.600
Let's start.

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:52.280
Me, too. I want to grow stronger.

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:56.130
Please order them, Basara-san!

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:58.860
Make everyone submit even more!

00:05:00.910 --> 00:05:01.880
All right.

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:04.560
Everyone, please strip.

00:05:04.560 --> 00:05:06.330
No, strip for me.

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:07.370
Yes.

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:21.630
<i>Basara...</i>

00:05:31.960 --> 00:05:33.640
<i>Basara's looking at us.</i>

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:38.270
<i>I-It's so embarrassing.</i>

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:41.780
<i>I'm... not...</i>

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:45.280
Let's go, everyone.

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:50.290
Um, excuse me.

00:05:50.890 --> 00:05:53.790
There are a few things we'd like to request.

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:59.920
"Give me your best efforts," the greenhorn prattles.

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:08.230
He doesn't even know what fortune is.

00:06:09.060 --> 00:06:10.960
A tournament, huh?

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:13.180
It should be good entertainment.

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:25.480
She's done already?

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:27.020
Bring the next lot.

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:27.750
As you wish.

00:06:40.610 --> 00:06:43.600
<i>Wilbert's child...</i>

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:46.970
I wonder how she tastes.

00:06:49.020 --> 00:06:50.180
Give it to me.

00:06:51.380 --> 00:06:53.460
Yes, Mio-sama.

00:07:05.260 --> 00:07:08.660
Now, Mio-sama, give Basara-san some, too.

00:07:21.970 --> 00:07:24.870
Is it tasty, Onii-chan?

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:26.260
Yeah.

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:42.070
Me too, Basara.

00:07:55.110 --> 00:07:56.420
Zest-san.

00:07:56.420 --> 00:07:57.310
Yes.

00:08:05.320 --> 00:08:06.970
Wh-What?

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:09.680
Why?

00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:12.050
I'm feeling kind of strange.

00:08:13.810 --> 00:08:15.580
It's jelly slime.

00:08:15.580 --> 00:08:19.630
It's a strong aphrodisiac that Maria requested for us.

00:08:21.610 --> 00:08:23.050
No.

00:08:23.050 --> 00:08:24.400
That's...

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:25.680
N-No...

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:30.640
Mio...

00:08:31.420 --> 00:08:33.030
This seems somewhat amazing.

00:08:58.970 --> 00:08:59.900
No.

00:09:02.170 --> 00:09:04.800
This is the best, Kuruki-san!

00:09:05.280 --> 00:09:09.710
This will explode my succubus power!

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:11.240
You know, you're...

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:22.730
You're adorable, Kuruki-san.

00:09:23.800 --> 00:09:25.550
They're having some fun, too.

00:09:36.530 --> 00:09:37.770
Basara-sama!

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:45.940
Basara-Nii-chan.

00:09:47.340 --> 00:09:49.440
Lick my underarms, too.

00:09:50.050 --> 00:09:53.390
I can't hold back anymore, Basara-san!

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:57.400
Me, neither. Give me more!

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:00.860
O-Onii-chan!

00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:05.640
Everyone, here we go.

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:49.580
At last, all the actors are here.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:03.440
Onii-chan...

00:11:07.280 --> 00:11:08.550
Onii...

00:11:13.820 --> 00:11:14.860
<i>Basara...</i>

00:11:24.560 --> 00:11:25.490
Hey!

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:28.490
This one's a shoo-in!

00:11:37.490 --> 00:11:38.500
What are you plotting?

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:42.030
Asking to meet me alone all of a sudden.

00:11:43.950 --> 00:11:45.510
Well, Basacchi?

00:11:47.110 --> 00:11:48.470
Sorry.

00:11:47.990 --> 00:11:50.170
Bring me another round of booze!

00:11:48.960 --> 00:11:50.170
You said it.

00:11:50.170 --> 00:11:53.860
Shut up! That comes after you pay the tab, you dumbass!

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:54.860
Two enemies having a secret meeting right before their tournament makes for a good scandal.

00:11:55.740 --> 00:11:58.820
Did you hear? Gald-sama was defeated.

00:11:58.820 --> 00:12:02.520
You think we're looking at 
another one soon? A big war.

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:05.000
So, what do you want to talk about?

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:07.790
If you're trying to rig the match, the price comes high.

00:12:07.430 --> 00:12:09.130
Damn straight!

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:11.820
But out of consideration for a classmate, I'll make do with your head.

00:12:16.060 --> 00:12:17.790
You're serious, huh?

00:12:19.520 --> 00:12:22.000
I'm always serious.

00:12:23.070 --> 00:12:26.570
Takigawa, I'd like to ask a favor from you.

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:27.550
"A favor"?

00:12:30.230 --> 00:12:32.300
I want you to acquire some perfume.

00:12:32.670 --> 00:12:34.810
P-Perfume?

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:37.310
Truth is...

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:39.830
I'm not going to let this one slide!{I'm not going to sit and let this stand}

00:12:39.830 --> 00:12:42.430
I'm ready to kill people anytime!

00:12:42.430 --> 00:12:45.320
Yeah! It gets my blood boiling!

00:13:02.500 --> 00:13:03.320
Mio!

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:08.700
Huh?

00:13:11.090 --> 00:13:11.950
Everyone...

00:13:14.910 --> 00:13:16.330
No way.

00:13:33.550 --> 00:13:34.870
Basara...?

00:13:39.740 --> 00:13:40.870
No...

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:47.130
No!

00:13:55.410 --> 00:13:56.470
Basara...

00:14:11.140 --> 00:14:14.260
Here, your order.

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:23.120
Thanks, please come again.

00:14:27.910 --> 00:14:29.160
Now then,

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:32.050
what are you planning, Basacchi?

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:01.200
Basara?

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:03.700
Mio.

00:15:04.660 --> 00:15:07.460
Were you contacting Jin-san?

00:15:07.940 --> 00:15:10.560
Yeah, something like that.

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:14.090
Now, let's hurry and get some sleep.

00:15:14.090 --> 00:15:15.970
Tomorrow's the tournament.

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:20.040
Mio?

00:15:21.460 --> 00:15:23.160
Don't act recklessly on your own.

00:15:43.560 --> 00:15:44.270
Mio.

00:15:51.020 --> 00:15:51.720
Mio,

00:15:52.980 --> 00:15:54.330
no matter what happens,

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:57.010
please believe in me.

00:16:21.010 --> 00:16:22.530
Onii-chan,

00:16:22.530 --> 00:16:25.040
you can still make me submit further.

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:38.550
My breasts grew this big because of you, Onii-chan.

00:16:38.550 --> 00:16:40.630
H-Hey...

00:16:40.630 --> 00:16:41.550
You know,

00:16:42.320 --> 00:16:44.000
I've always thought

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:46.650
about how glad I am to have met you.

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:49.750
What are you saying all of a sudden?

00:16:50.560 --> 00:16:51.800
Well...

00:17:25.350 --> 00:17:27.300
Your Majesty!

00:17:27.300 --> 00:17:29.350
Long live Leohart-sama!

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:34.660
It's like some spectacle.

00:17:34.660 --> 00:17:39.320
Gather spectators so Your Majesty can
 demonstrate your victory to the people.

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:41.360
Sounds like a good excuse for the council.

00:17:42.340 --> 00:17:43.760
Damn fossils.

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:52.870
I see. So you're their representative, huh?

00:17:53.410 --> 00:17:55.040
Let me just tell you this!

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:59.960
In this battle, I won't be fighting as
 the former Demon Lord's daughter!

00:18:01.130 --> 00:18:04.890
I'll be fighting as myself— as Naruse Mio!

00:18:05.860 --> 00:18:09.390
Do as you please. The result won't change either way.

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:13.050
Now, it's what you've all waited for!

00:18:13.050 --> 00:18:17.530
The sparks of battle are about to start flying!

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:20.730
Victory is simple:

00:18:20.730 --> 00:18:24.570
render your opponent unable to fight or kill them!

00:18:24.570 --> 00:18:28.010
The pathetic losers will get axed on the spot!

00:18:28.910 --> 00:18:32.410
And furthermore! The glorious winner will obtain...

00:18:32.860 --> 00:18:35.590
The late Wilbert's daughter!

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:38.630
This woman, Naruse Mio!

00:18:43.420 --> 00:18:47.320
Eh?! I never heard about this!

00:18:49.360 --> 00:18:50.050
Your Majesty...

00:18:51.950 --> 00:18:53.440
It's Belphegor?

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:56.550
Yes. Sir Madonis wishes to speak with you.

00:18:58.270 --> 00:18:59.190
It's me.

00:18:59.190 --> 00:19:03.410
Lord Belphegor is still nowhere to be found.

00:19:04.170 --> 00:19:09.200
It's possible he might be indulging in the pleasure quarters.

00:19:09.730 --> 00:19:11.180
I see.

00:19:11.180 --> 00:19:13.590
Also, one of their members...

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:19.210
Basara-san...

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:22.190
Do you think the council sprung something?

00:19:23.340 --> 00:19:25.010
Who knows?

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:26.800
But this is part of war, too.

00:19:30.340 --> 00:19:32.720
Now, are you ready?!

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:35.730
The stage is set!

00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:38.980
Let's use this tournament to make a bloodbath

00:19:38.980 --> 00:19:42.700
of those fools who would oppose His Majesty Leohart!

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:51.870
First Stage!

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:56.000
Luka versus Naruse Mio!

00:19:56.680 --> 00:19:58.500
You're my opponent?

00:19:58.820 --> 00:20:02.250
Yes, but you won't be facing me.{Yes, but it won't be me you'll be fighting.}

00:20:10.840 --> 00:20:11.810
A heroic spirit?

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:20.770
The first up to fight is His Majesty 
Leohart's favorite little hero, Luka!

00:20:21.140 --> 00:20:24.240
The ancient heroic spirit he wields will bring

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:27.110
bright red flowers of blood into bloom!

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:31.410
Please don't think poorly of me.

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:33.780
I can't afford to lose when I'm fighting

00:20:35.800 --> 00:20:37.790
in Gald-san's stead!

00:20:38.240 --> 00:20:41.810
First match! Luka versus Naruse Mio!

00:20:41.810 --> 00:20:43.790
Go! Fight!

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:47.050
Go! Heroic Spirit!

00:21:00.460 --> 00:21:01.600
Huh?!

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:06.070
What's with that?!

00:21:07.720 --> 00:21:10.240
It has regenerative abilities, as well?

00:21:11.860 --> 00:21:13.970
There are more surprises to come!

00:21:16.870 --> 00:21:17.830
Mio-sama!

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:27.180
Go!

00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:28.370
Crush her!

00:21:28.370 --> 00:21:29.880
Kill her!

00:21:33.300 --> 00:21:37.160
There's something I have to do for this battle.

00:21:37.860 --> 00:21:38.690
But...

00:21:39.430 --> 00:21:41.620
I promise I <i>will</i> return.

00:21:41.620 --> 00:21:42.980
Believe in me.

00:21:48.360 --> 00:21:50.570
<i>Basara promised to return.</i>

00:21:51.180 --> 00:21:53.030
<i>So I know he'll come back.</i>

00:21:54.540 --> 00:21:55.510
<i>So I have to...</i>

00:21:57.580 --> 00:21:59.580
Now! This is the end!

00:22:04.500 --> 00:22:06.290
Mio-sama!

00:22:11.550 --> 00:22:12.550
What?!

00:22:18.360 --> 00:22:20.310
I'll kill you a hundred times over!  {no edit here please}

00:22:29.230 --> 00:22:30.380
No way.

00:22:30.380 --> 00:22:33.280
The heroic spirit along with its self-recovery function...

00:22:38.440 --> 00:22:41.260
W-Winner of the first match is...

00:22:41.260 --> 00:22:42.830
Naruse Mio!

00:22:43.980 --> 00:22:45.690
H-How incredible.

00:22:45.690 --> 00:22:48.340
That girl is strong!

00:22:48.810 --> 00:22:51.080
You did it, Mio-sama!

00:22:51.080 --> 00:22:53.620
I wouldn't be able to face him if I didn't.

00:22:53.620 --> 00:22:54.340
Huh?

00:22:54.670 --> 00:22:57.780
Not if I lost before Basara returned.

00:23:03.360 --> 00:23:05.730
Mio-sama, I'm heading out.

00:23:09.640 --> 00:23:12.370
That was impressive of Mio-sama.

00:23:13.200 --> 00:23:17.720
Now, let's get ourselves ready for the second match!

00:23:18.350 --> 00:23:20.570
<i>Do your best, Maria.</i>

00:23:21.240 --> 00:23:23.200
With these folks getting cocky after their first victory,

00:23:23.200 --> 00:23:25.070
it's time to show them the harsh reality!{it's time to teach them the harsh reality!}

00:23:24.240 --> 00:23:25.070
<i>I won't lose either.</i>

00:23:25.070 --> 00:23:28.290
Look at Maria showing off her composure!

00:23:28.290 --> 00:23:31.030
She's started taking her time stretching!

00:23:31.030 --> 00:23:35.470
Her opponent, our hero, is taking the stage!{Her opponent and our hero is taking the stage!}

00:23:35.470 --> 00:23:37.760
So you're my opponent?

00:23:39.080 --> 00:23:40.760
Looks that way.

00:23:40.760 --> 00:23:43.120
Second Stage!

00:23:43.120 --> 00:23:45.770
Lars versus Maria!

00:23:47.490 --> 00:23:49.020
<i>Why?</i>

00:23:49.020 --> 00:23:51.020
<i>Why is Lars...</i>
